        "code": "// One IN filter for the whole page of positions - three fetches total, however many\n// positions came back. The '__none__' sentinel keeps an empty page a clean no-op\n// instead of an unfiltered scan.\ndef ids = []\nif (rows != null) rows.each { r -> ids << String.valueOf(r.id) }\ndef useIds = ids.isEmpty() ? ['__none__'] : ids\ndef filters = [\n    [property: 'properties.positionId',     filter: [operator: 'IN',  value: useIds]],\n    [property: 'properties.effectiveStart', filter: [operator: 'LTE', value: asOfEpoch]]]\nreturn [positionIds: useIds, positionCount: ids.size(),\n        filter: [operator: 'AND', filters: filters]]",
        "compile_static": false,
